    "label": "11",
    "prompt": "For a rectangle of length $\\ell$ cm and width $w$ cm, the perimeter $P$ cm is given by $P=2(\\ell+w)$.\n\nUse this formula to calculate the length of a rectangle which has width 15 cm and perimeter 57 cm.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$13.5\\text{ cm}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}57&=2(\\ell+15)\\\\28.5&=\\ell+15\\\\\\ell&=28.5-15\\\\\\ell&=13.5\\end{align*}$$\nThe length is $13.5\\text{ cm}$.",
